# Declares intent: test evidence is referenced by path in reports, never loaded
# wholesale into context. See docs/artifact-strategy.md and
# .claude/rules/core/token-discipline.md.
#
# NOTE: Claude Code does not currently enforce .claudeignore for tool reads
# (verified 2026-09-05: a file under evidence/ was still readable via the Read
# tool). This file documents the policy; the enforced mechanisms are the
# permissions denylist in .claude/settings.json and the PreToolUse guard. For a
# hard boundary on artifacts, add Read(evidence/**) to permissions.deny.
evidence/
!evidence/README.md

# Secrets — defense in depth alongside .gitignore and the permissions denylist
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Installer backups and node_modules never need to be in context
*.bak-*
node_modules/
